# GP-VAE Endo: keep only code, configs and docs in git.
# Folder patterns start with **/ so they also match if the code moves into a subfolder.

# --- Data (21 GB: preprocessed .npz videos, raw frames, C3VD sheets) ---
/Data/*
# ...but not the code package gpvae_endo/data/ (on Windows, git ignores case, so **/Data/ matched it too)
!gpvae_endo/data/
# ...except exactly one sample NPZ per dataset (stored with Git LFS, see .gitattributes); everything else
# in Data/ and in these three folders stays ignored
!/Data/c3vd/
!/Data/kvasir/
!/Data/hyperkvasir/
/Data/c3vd/*
/Data/kvasir/*
/Data/hyperkvasir/*
*.npz
!/Data/c3vd/c1_descending_t1_v2 336 X Ym01sGM.npz
!/Data/kvasir/kvasir_7ad22d50ebaf4596 336 X Ym01sGM.npz
!/Data/hyperkvasir/hyperkvasir-camera_a_b2c2110b-4047-4b5f-aaa4-0e2cc4ace9ed_ 336 X Ym01sGM.npz
*.npy
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov

# --- Pretrained and trained weights (2.1 GB) ---
**/Models/Weights/
/weights/
**/Saved_Models/
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# --- Outputs written by runs (config_endo.py: FOLDER_LOGS/OUTPUT/DEBUG/MODELS) ---
**/Logs/
**/Pics/
**/Debug/
**/Resulting_Masks/
**/tmp/
**/test_percentage_rmse_analysis/
**/runs/
**/outputs/
**/wandb/
**/lightning_logs/

# --- Experiment records (appended by the driver; results, not code) ---
**/Experiment_Summaries.txt
**/Experiment log.txt
**/Experiment log trajectories.txt
*.xlsx

# --- Camera-calibration images (118 MB of .tiff); Calib_Cam.m and .mat params stay ---
**/Utils/Cam_Calib/cfhq190l_10x10mm_checkerboard_images*/
*.tiff
*.tif

# --- Job output ---
*.out
*.err

# --- Dead code kept locally ---
**/Trash/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyc.*
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
.cache/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Local working notes (Claude Code guidance, plan, progress log) ---
/CLAUDE.md
/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
/IMPLEMENTATION_PROGRESS.md

# --- Golden-run outputs (reference.json next to them is tracked) ---
tests/golden/out/
docs/review_scripts/out/

# --- Editors and OS ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local only: cluster job scripts and internal review notes ---
/slurm/
/docs/findings.md

# --- Upload archives ---
/*.tar
/*.tar.gz
